 "決まりごと": "قَانُون, قَاعِدَة (A regulation, law, guideline.) / حُكْم, حُكُومَة (The act of ruling; administration of law; government; empire; authority; control) / حَكَمَ (To regulate, be in charge of, make decisions for, reign over.)  [rule]\nمثال: 厳格な父親は、徹底したしつけによって子供たちに決まりごとを守らせる。\n→ A strict father makes his children toe the line by thorough training.",
 "決まり事": "قَانُون, قَاعِدَة (A regulation, law, guideline.) / حُكْم, حُكُومَة (The act of ruling; administration of law; government; empire; authority; control) / حَكَمَ (To regulate, be in charge of, make decisions for, reign over.)  [rule]\nمثال: 厳格な父親は、徹底したしつけによって子供たちに決まりごとを守らせる。\n→ A strict father makes his children toe the line by thorough training.",
