 "注意": "اِهْتِمَام, اِنْتِبَاه (Mental focus.)  [attention]\nمثال: 健康にもっと注意を払うべきだ。\n→ You should pay more attention to your health. / اِهْتِمَام (Close attention; concern; responsibility.) / عِنَايَة, رِعَايَة (The treatment of those in need (especially as a profession).) / اِهْتَمَّ بِـ (To be concerned (about), to have an interest (in); to feel concern (about).) / اِهْتَمَّ بِـ ((with for) To look after or look out for.)  [care]\nمثال: 寝坊しないように注意しなさい。\n→ Take care not to oversleep. / نَصِيحَة, مَشُورَة (An opinion offered to guide behavior in an effort to be helpful.)  [advice]\nمثال: 彼に遅れないように注意した。\n→ I cautioned him against being late. / عَزْر (A severe, formal or official reproof; reprehension, rebuke, private or public.) / توبيخ ;تقريع (To reprove in a formal or official way.)  [reprimand]\nمثال: あの態度、きつく注意してやらんと。\n→ I have to tell him off for his bad attitude.",
