 "注文": "تَرْتِيب, نِظَام (Arrangement, disposition, or sequence.) / أَمْر, حُكْم (A command.) / طَلَب (A request for some product or service; a commission to purchase, sell, or supply) / جَمَاعَة (A group of religious adherents, especially monks or nuns, set apart within their) / وِسَام (A decoration, awarded by a government, a dynastic house, or a religious body to ) / رُتْبَة (A category in the classification of organisms, ranking below class and above fam) / أَمَرَ (To issue a command to; to charge.) / طَلَبَ, حَجَزَ (To request some product or service; to secure by placing an order.)  [order (for an item)]\nمثال: あなたのためにデザートを注文した。\n→ I've ordered you some dessert. / طَلَبَ (to express the need or desire for) / طَلَب, مَسْأَلَة (Act of requesting (with the adposition at in the presence of possessives, and on)  [request]\nمثال: 貴社のご提案に対し、私どもはこのご注文について５％の特別値引きをさせていただくことにします。\n→ In reply to your request, we offer you an extra discount of 5% on this order.",
