 "流し": "غَطَسَ (To move or be moved into something.) / مَجْلَى, مَغْسَلَة (A basin used for holding water for washing.)  [sink (e.g. in a kitchen)]\nمثال: ガラスのコップを流しにおこうとしたら手が滑って、ガシャッと割れた。\n→ When I tried to set the glass down in the sink my hand slipped and it shattered to pieces. / رِحْلَة بَحْرِيَّة (A sea or lake voyage, especially one taken for pleasure.)  [cruising (e.g. taxi)]\nمثال: 彼は流しのタクシーを止めた。\n→ He hailed a cruising taxi. / [washing area (in a Japanese-style bath)] / [back-washing service (in a public bath)]",
