 "流す": "بَالُوعَة (An access point or conduit for rainwater that drains directly downstream in a (d)  [to drain]\nمثال: あんな恐ろしい男のために流す涙はない。\n→ I cannot shed a tear for that horrible man. / طَفَا, عَامَ (To be supported by a fluid of greater density (than the object).) / طَفَا (To be capable of floating.)  [to float (e.g. logs down a river)] / [to wash away ; to carry away]\nمثال: たくさんの家が洪水で流された。\n→ A lot of houses were washed away by the flood. / تَلْفَزَة, إِذَاعَة (A transmission of a radio or television programme intended to be received by any) / أَذَاعَ, بَثَّ (To transmit a message or signal through radio waves or electronic means.)  [to broadcast]\nمثال: 彼は夕方のニュースで、その殺人の裁判を最初に流すことに決めた。\n→ He decided to put the murder trial first in the evening news.",
 "流ちょう": "طَلِق, فَصِيح (Able to use a language accurately, rapidly, and confidently.)  [fluent (in a language)]\nمثال: デビッドは流暢にフランス語を話すことができる。\n→ David can speak French fluently.",
