 "流派": "مَدْرَسَة, مَكْتَب (An institution dedicated to teaching and learning; an educational institution.) / كُلِّيَّة, جَامِعَة (An educational institution providing primary and secondary education, prior to t) / قِسِم (Within a larger educational institution, an organizational unit, such as a depar) / مَدْرَسَة (The followers of a particular doctrine; a particular way of thinking or particul)  [school (of painting, ikebana, etc.)]\nمثال: その作品は小説の新流派を生むだろう。\n→ The work will give birth to a new school of novel.",
