 "流行": "مُودَة, مُوضَة (A current (constantly changing) trend, favored for frivolous rather than practic)  [fashion]\nمثال: あの種の服が今流行だ。\n→ That kind of dress is now in fashion. / اِنْتِشَار (The total number of cases of a disease in a given statistical population at a gi)  [prevalence (of a disease)]",
