 "流行り": "مُودَة, مُوضَة (A current (constantly changing) trend, favored for frivolous rather than practic)  [fashion]\nمثال: これが最近はやりの服ですか。\n→ Is this dress the latest fashion? / اِنْتِشَار (The total number of cases of a disease in a given statistical population at a gi)  [prevalence (e.g. of a disease)]",
