 "浮いた": "عِشْقِيّ, غَرَامِيّ (Of or relating to, or produced by, love.) / عَاشِق (Affected with love; in love; enamored.)  [amorous] / إِشَارَة مُرُور, إِشَارَة ضَوْئِيَّة (A source of illumination.) / نُور, ضَوْء (A flame or something used to create fire.) / أَشْعَلَ, أَوْقَدَ (To start (a fire).) / أَضَاءَ (To illuminate; to provide light for when it is dark.) / مُنِير (Having light; bright; clear; not dark or obscure.) / فَاتِح (Pale or whitish in color; highly luminous and more or less deficient in chroma.) / خَفِيف (of low weight) / خفيف (of low weight) / خفيف (of low weight)  [light] / [flamboyant]",
