 "浮かばれる": "اُرْقُد فِي سَلَام, اُرْقُد بِسَلَام (To have passed away, or to have died.)  [to rest in peace]\nusu. neg. / [to gain recognition ; to get on in the world]",
 "浮かび上がる": "[to rise to the surface] / ظَهَرَ (To come into view.)  [to emerge (e.g. from obscurity)] / [to stand out (e.g. against a dark background)]\nمثال: その木は空にくっきりと浮かび上がっていた。\n→ The tree was clearly defined against the sky.",
 "浮かび出る": "سَطْح (The overside or upside of a flat object such as a table, or of a liquid.) / سَطْح (The locus of an equation (especially one with exactly two degrees of freedom) in) / طفا إلى السطح (To rise to the surface.) / طفا إلى السطح (To become known or apparent; to appear or be found; to come to light.)  [to surface]",
