 "湯沸かし": "غَلَّايَة (A vessel used to boil water for tea or other hot beverages.)  [teakettle]\nمثال: 鍋が湯わかしを黒いという。\n→ The pot calls the kettle black.",
 "湯沸し": "غَلَّايَة (A vessel used to boil water for tea or other hot beverages.)  [teakettle]\nمثال: 鍋が湯わかしを黒いという。\n→ The pot calls the kettle black.",
 "湯浴み": "حَمَّام, مُغْسَل (A tub or pool which is used for bathing: bathtub.) / حَمَّام, مُغْتَسَل (A building or area where bathing occurs.) / اِسْتِحْمَام, اِغْتِسَال (The act of bathing; an instance of this; the taking of a bath.)  [(taking a) bath]",
