 "湿式": "مُبْتَلّ (Made up of liquid or moisture, usually (but not always) water.) / مَبْلُول, مُبْتَلّ (Of an object, etc.: covered or impregnated with liquid, usually (but not always))  [wet (process)]",
 "湿性": "مُبْتَلّ (Made up of liquid or moisture, usually (but not always) water.) / مَبْلُول, مُبْتَلّ (Of an object, etc.: covered or impregnated with liquid, usually (but not always))  [wet (pleurisy)]",
 "湿気": "رُطُوبَة (The state of being moist.)  [moisture]\nمثال: 夏はとても湿気が多いんです。\n→ In the summer, it's very humid.",
