 "満幅": "مُمْتَلِئ, مَلِيء (Containing the maximum possible amount that can fit in the space available.) / شِبَع, شبعان (Having the attention, thoughts, etc., absorbed in any matter, and the feelings m)  [full]",
 "満年齢": "عُمْر (The amount of time that some being has been alive, or that some thing has been i) / سِنّ (Any particular stage of life.)  [age (expressed in the Western style of counting fully completed years)]",
 "満座": "الْجَمِيع, كُلّ شَخْص (Every individual in a set; every person.)  [everyone]\nمثال: 花嫁は伏目がちに、満座の注目を浴びながら入場した。\n→ The bride came into the room with lowered eyes and with everyone staring at her.",
