 "満洲": "مَنْشُورِيَا (Synonym of Manchukuo: a former puppet state of Imperial Japan.)  [Manchuria] / [Manchukuo (Japanese Manchurian puppet state; 1932-1945)]",
 "満点": "[perfect score ; full marks]\nمثال: 彼は数学で満点を取った。\n→ He got full marks in mathematics. / كَامِل (Fitting its definition precisely.) / كَامِل (Having all of its parts in harmony with a common purpose.) / أَتْقَنَ (To make perfect; to improve or hone.)  [perfect]\nمثال: ベッドは寝心地満点だった。\n→ I found the bed quite comfortable.",
