 "満腹": "[full stomach ; filling one's stomach]\nمثال: 満腹なので、もうこれ以上食べられない。\n→ I am full, and I can eat no more. / اِنْتَهَى, أَكْمَلَ (To finish; to make done; to reach the end.) / كَامِل (With all parts included; with nothing missing; full.) / ذَرِيع (Generic intensifier.)  [complete]",
