 "満足": "رِضَا, إِشْبَاع (A fulfilment of a need or desire.)  [satisfaction]\nمثال: 彼は努めて雇い主を満足させようとした。\n→ He was zealous in satisfying his employer. / كَافٍ (sufficient) / تَمَامًا (Sufficiently.) / مَه, كَفَى (Stop! Don't do that any more! It is too much!)  [enough]\nمثال: いつもあかだらけで、食事も満足に与えられていない様子でした。\n→ He was always filthy and looked like he wasn't given enough food. / رَضَّى (to be enough (for))  [satisfying (an equation)]",
