 "源": "مَصْدَر, مَصَادِر (The person, place, or thing from which something (information, goods, etc.) come) / عَيْن (Spring; fountainhead; wellhead; any collection of water on or under the surface ) / مَصْدَر (A reporter's informant.)  [source (of a river)] / مَصْدَر, مَصَادِر (The person, place, or thing from which something (information, goods, etc.) come) / عَيْن (Spring; fountainhead; wellhead; any collection of water on or under the surface ) / مَصْدَر (A reporter's informant.)  [source]",
