 "焉んぞ": "كَيْف, ازاي (In what manner) / كَيْفَ, ازاي (In what manner:) / كَيْفَ, ازاي (In what state or condition.) / كَمْ, يَا لَ (Used as a modifier to indicate surprise, delight, or other strong feelings in an)  [how]",
