 "無しに": "بِدُونِ, بِلَا (Not having, containing, characteristic of, etc.)  [without]",
 "無しには": "بِدُونِ, بِلَا (Not having, containing, characteristic of, etc.)  [without]\nمثال: この辞書なしには済まされない。\n→ I can't do without this dictionary.",
 "無にする": "تَعَسُّف, طُغْيَان (Improper treatment or usage; application to a wrong or bad purpose; an unjust, c) / مَسَبَّة, شَتِيمَة (Coarse, insulting speech; abusive language; language that unjustly or angrily vi) / إِيذَاء جَسَدِيّ (Physical maltreatment; injury; cruel treatment.) / اِنْتِهَاك جَسَدِيّ (Violation; defilement; rape; forcing of undesired sexual activity by one person ) / أَسَاءَ اِسْتِعْمَالَ (To put to a wrong use; to misapply; to use improperly; to use for a wrong purpos) / آذَى (To injure; to maltreat; to hurt; to treat with cruelty, especially repeatedly.) / أَهَانَ, سَبَّ (To attack with coarse language; to insult; to revile; malign; to speak in an off) / اِغْتَصَبَ, اِنْتَهَكَ (To violate; defile; to rape; (reflexive) to masturbate.) / خَدَعَ, غَشَّ (To deceive; to trick; to impose on; misuse the confidence of.)  [to abuse (esp. another's kindness)]\nمثال: 彼は昇進の機会を無にした。\n→ He threw away his chance of promotion. / فَارِغ (Devoid of content; containing nothing or nobody; vacant.) / فَرَغَ (To make empty; to remove the contents of.)  [to empty]\nas in 心を無にする, etc.",
 "無みする": "تَجَاهَلَ, طَنَّش (To deliberately not listen or pay attention to.)  [to ignore]",
 "無一文": "فقير (utterly without money)  [penniless]\nمثال: 彼は無一文だ。\n→ He is as poor as a rat.",
