 "無下に": "تَمَامًا (In a complete manner; thoroughly.)  [completely]\nمثال: 他ならぬ君の頼みなら、無下には出来ないだろう。\n→ If it's a request from you, I'm hardly likely to be able to turn you down flat.",
 "無下にする": "إِهْمال (The act or state of deliberately not paying attention or caring about something.)  [to disregard]",
 "無事": "أَمْن, أَمَان (The condition or feeling of being safe; security; certainty.)  [safety]\nمثال: 彼の無事を知らされて、部長は安堵のため息をついた。\n→ Informed of his safety, the manager breathed a sigh of relief. / بِسَلَام, بِأَمَان (In a safe manner; without risk; using caution above all else.)  [safely]\nمثال: 積み荷は無事届きました。\n→ The shipment has reached us safely. / [good health] / [inaction ; ennui]",
