 "無人航空機": "يَعْسُوب, يَمْخُور (A male hymenopteran (ant, bee, hornet, or wasp), whose sole primary function is ) / مُسَيَّرَة, طَائِرَة بِدُونِ طَيَّار (Any remotely operated or autonomous vehicle for land, sea, air, or space.)  [drone]",
 "無人販売所": "آلَة بَيْع, آلَة بَيْع ذَاتِيّ (An automatic machine that dispenses merchandise (often food or beverages) in ret)  [vending machine]\nمثال: こういう野菜の無人販売所は、都会では見かけないよね。\n→ You don't see this kind of vegetable vending machine in the city.",
