 "無理": "[unreasonable ; unnatural]\nمثال: それは無理な注文だ。\n→ Your demands are unreasonable. / مُسْتَحِيل (Not possible; not able to be done or happen.) / مُسْتَحِيل (An impossibility.)  [impossible] / قُوَّة (Ability to influence; strength or energy of body or mind; active power; vigour; ) / قُوَّة (Anything that is able to make a substantial change in a person or thing.) / أَجْبَرَ, اِضْطَرَّ (To compel (an adversary or partner) to trump a trick by leading a suit that he/s)  [forced]\noft. adverbially as 〜に / مُفْرِط, زَائِد (Exceeding the usual bounds of something; too much (of amount); extravagant; immo)  [excessive (work, etc.)]",
