 "無理はない": "طَبِيعِيّ (of or relating to nature)  [natural]\noft. as 〜のも無理はない\nمثال: 私にはうれしくはなかったが、ほかのあらゆるものと同じ様にトニーの価格も上がるのは無理はないと思い、同意した。\n→ I wasn't happy, but it seemed reasonable that his prices should go up like everything else, so I agreed.",
 "無理もない": "طَبِيعِيّ (of or relating to nature)  [natural]\nمثال: 無理もないわ、はじめのうちは、そんな風に感じるものよね。\n→ It's reasonable that you feel that way at first.",
 "無理圧状": "قَهْر, قَسْر (Actual or threatened force for the purpose of compelling action by another perso) / إِكْرَاه (Use of physical or moral force to compel a person to do something, or to abstain)  [coercion]",
 "無理強い": "قُوَّة (Ability to influence; strength or energy of body or mind; active power; vigour; ) / قُوَّة (Anything that is able to make a substantial change in a person or thing.) / أَجْبَرَ, اِضْطَرَّ (To compel (an adversary or partner) to trump a trick by leading a suit that he/s)  [forcing]\nمثال: 私は彼を無理強いして私の意向に従わせた。\n→ I forced him into complying with my wish.",
 "無理往生": "قَهْر, قَسْر (Actual or threatened force for the purpose of compelling action by another perso) / إِكْرَاه (Use of physical or moral force to compel a person to do something, or to abstain)  [coercion]",
 "無理押し": "جَرَّفَ (To destroy with a bulldozer.)  [bulldozing]\nمثال: 地方自治体では新しい開発プロジェクトを無理押ししようとしています。\n→ Local officials are twisting arms to push new development projects.",
 "無理無い": "طَبِيعِيّ (of or relating to nature)  [natural]",
