 "無益": "عَدِيمُ الْفَائِدَةِ (Without use or the possibility to be used.)  [useless]\nمثال: 自分が生きている世界との共感がなければ、作家であることは無益である。\n→ It is no use being a writer if one is not in sympathy with the world in which one is living.",
 "無矛盾性": "اِتِّسَاق (Reliability or uniformity; the quality of being consistent.) / اِتِّسَاق (Freedom from contradiction; the state of a system of axioms such that none of th)  [consistency (of an axiomatic system)]",
 "無知": "جَهْل, جَهَالَة (The condition of being uninformed or uneducated; lack of knowledge or informatio)  [ignorance]\nمثال: 彼はすぐに無知をさらけ出した。\n→ He soon betrayed his ignorance.",
 "無知は幸福": "الْجَهْل نَعِيمَهُ, الْجَهْل نِعْمَة (A lack of knowledge or awareness about certain facts or situations results in ha)  [ignorance is bliss]",
