 "然もなくば": "خِلَافَ, خِلَافَ ذَلِك (Differently, in another way.) / وَإِلَّا (In different circumstances; or else.) / عَكْس ذٰلِك (In all other respects; apart from that; except for this.)  [otherwise]\nمثال: 何か言うことがあれば、今言ってくれ。さもなくば黙っていてくれ。\n→ If you have something to say, say it now or pipe down.",
