 "煽り": "هَبَّة (A strong, abrupt rush of wind.)  [gust (of wind)]\nمثال: その会社は競争の激化のあおりを受けて、倒産した。\n→ Having fallen victim to increased competition, the company went bankrupt. / نَفُوذ, تَأْثِير (The power to affect, control or manipulate something or someone; the ability to ) / تَأْثِير (An action exerted by a person or thing with such power on another to cause chang) / أَثَّرَ (To have an effect on by using gentle or subtle action; to exert an influence upo)  [influence] / تَحْرِيض (A call to act; encouragement to act, often in an illegal way.)  [incitement] / [tailgating]",
