 "片": "وَاحِد, وَاحِدَة (The number represented by the Arabic numeral 1; the numerical value equal to tha) / اَلْمَرْء (Any person (applying to people in general).)  [one (of a pair)] / ناقص-غير كامل (A tense of verbs used in describing a past action that is incomplete or continuo)  [imperfect] / قَلِيل (An indefinite, but usually small, number of.) / قَلِيل (Not many; a small (in comparison with another number stated or implied) but some) / قَلِيل (Few people, few things.)  [few] / بَعِيد, نَاءٍ (At a distance; disconnected.) / نَاءٍ (Emotionally detached.)  [remote]",
