 "片が付く": "اِسْتَعْمَرَ (to fix one's dwelling) / اِسْتَوْطَنَ (to fix one's dwelling) / اِسْتَقَرَّ (to fix one's dwelling)  [to settle (a problem)]\nمثال: その論争は完全に片が付いた。\n→ That dispute has been settled once and for all.",
