 "片すみ": "زَاوِيَة, رُكْن (The point where two converging lines meet; an angle, either external or internal)  [corner]\nمثال: その学校は、中・高一貫校だということを頭の片隅にでも入れておいて下さい。\n→ Bear in mind that that school is an integrated junior high and high school.",
