 "版権所有": "جَمِيع اَلْحُقُوق مَحْفُوظَة, كَافَّة اَلْحُقُوق مَحْفُوظَة (The copyright holder of a creative work reserves all copyright-related rights, t)  [all rights reserved]",
 "版行": "نَشَرَ, أَصْدَرَ (To issue (something, such as printed work) for distribution and/or sale.)  [publishing] / فُقْمَة (A pinniped (Pinnipedia), particularly an earless seal (true seal) or eared seal.) / خَتْم (A stamp used to impress a design on a soft substance such as wax.) / خَتْم (A facsimile of an impression of such stamp that is a mark or symbol of an office)  [seal (used in lieu of a signature)]",
